    focus: 'Verify whether the degeneracy-gating causal chain (3 datasets: CoNLL 58%→fail,
      SciERC 21%→weak, Few-NERD 10%→strong LP selection) plus cross-dataset "correlation≠selection"
      validation pushes the paper from Findings 3.0 to Main Conference ≥3.5. Key improvements
      since Dream #2: (1) predictive mechanism with 3 data points, (2) LP significance
      on Few-NERD p<0.001, (3) bootstrap significance tests, (4) regime-dependent
      claim properly qualified, (5) Fomicheva 2020 + literature integration, (6) all
      numerical corrections verified.'
